<h1>Stale Users Report</h1>
<h3>Deleting users will prevent them from logging into the system and from accessing resources that belong to them.  Attached resources that will be removed include; ePortfolio, My Files, Pastoral Records and My Links.  Resources shared with or by the user like Files, Grades, News, Forum Posts and other collaborative activities will remain available.</h3>
<div id='stale-users-report'>
    <stale-users-report
            date-format="{{ config.date_local | momentJsFormat }}"
    />
</div>
<script type="text/javascript" src="/javascript/components/staleUsersReport.bundle.js?v={{ config.site_version }}"></script>
